<< /AP << /N 123 0 R >> /BS 40 0 R /Contents (Part \(i\) was done well.  Part \(ii\) was generally done well but many students did not\rknow what to do with the square root of x in the integrand.) /CreationDate (D:20160615133512+10'00') /DA (13.75 TL /Cour 10 Tf) /DS (font: Helv 10.0pt;font-stretch:Normal; text-align:left; color:#000000 ) /F 4 /IT /FreeTextTypewriter /M (D:20160615133657+10'00') /NM (dff80a27-7104-4b12-821d-bb812fec4eb6) /P 21 0 R /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:11.0.16" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Helv;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:13.8pt;font-family:Helvetica">Part \(i\) was done well.  Part \(ii\) was generally done well but many students did not&#13;</span></p><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:13.8pt;font-family:Helvetica">know what to do with the square root of x in the integrand.</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 53.065 33.2653 415.468 74.5253 ] /Subj (Typewritten Text) /Subtype /FreeText /T (kilmoreb) /Type /Annot >>
<< /AP << /N 124 0 R >> /BS 40 0 R /CreationDate (D:20160615133832+10'00') /DA (13.75 TL /Cour 10 Tf) /DS (font: Helvetica,monospace 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 ) /F 4 /IT /FreeTextTypewriter /M (D:20160615133834+10'00') /NM (8c040686-4ae0-4aaa-b1fd-58b6b5e9844f) /P 21 0 R /Rect [ 636.043 25.6746 650.443 37.6746 ] /Subj (Typewritten Text) /Subtype /FreeText /T (kilmoreb) /Type /Annot >>
<< /AP << /N 125 0 R >> /BS 40 0 R /Contents (Part \(i\) done well\rPart \(ii\) : Many students did not use the Pythagorean identity for sec^2 -1. Also some had trouble with the bounds.) /CreationDate (D:20160615133854+10'00') /DA (13.75 TL /Cour 10 Tf) /DS (font: Helv 10.0pt;font-stretch:Normal; text-align:left; color:#000000 ) /F 4 /IT /FreeTextTypewriter /M (D:20160615133915+10'00') /NM (220ec9e6-6f6f-468a-bdef-0ffe021c5d88) /P 21 0 R /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:11.0.16" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Helv;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:13.8pt;font-family:Helvetica">Part \(i\) done well&#13;</span></p><p dir="ltr"><span style="line-height:13.8pt;font-family:Helvetica">Part \(ii\) : Many students did not use the Pythagorean identity for sec^2 -1. Also some had trouble with the bounds.</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 689.108 4.29129 831.662 73.0513 ] /Subj (Typewritten Text) /Subtype /FreeText /T (kilmoreb) /Type /Annot >>
